On Tuesday.

215
00:15:41,140 --> 00:15:41,980
On Wednesday.

216
00:15:42,010 --> 00:15:44,590
We don't use articles with months.

217
00:15:44,590 --> 00:15:45,520
In June.

218
00:15:45,730 --> 00:15:46,840
In December.

219
00:15:47,470 --> 00:15:48,250
In May.

220
00:15:49,540 --> 00:15:52,780
And at night.

221
00:15:53,830 --> 00:15:55,350
No article here.

222
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:57,250
But in the morning.

223
00:15:57,250 --> 00:15:58,360
In the afternoon.

224
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,560
In the evening.

225
00:16:00,220 --> 00:16:01,390
So at night.

226
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:03,040
But in the morning.

227
00:16:03,040 --> 00:16:03,970
In the afternoon.

228
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:04,680
In the evening.

229
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:06,250
So this is an exception.

230
00:16:06,250 --> 00:16:06,850
Sorry.

231
00:16:08,290 --> 00:16:15,340
Some other phrases, I suggest you just remember those, right, in/at/to work.

