00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:20,400
Right?

236
00:16:20,650 --> 00:16:22,300
In work.

237
00:16:22,300 --> 00:16:23,140
At work.

238
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:24,010
To work.

239
