00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:44,250
So when you talk about your education so remember to not use any article there. At school, at college,

244
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:45,240
at university.

245
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:48,330
So that's all.

246
00:16:48,330 --> 00:16:52,170
When it comes to articles, you learned a lot today.

247
00:16:52,260 --> 00:17:00,480
You learned when to use article a, when to use article the, when to use no article.

248
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:00,990
Right.

